            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Katy Boland"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent!!! I did add 4 garlic cloves (we love garlic) to the meat and onions while it was cooking, but other than that I followed the recipe exactly. I also made my own egg noodles from a recipe on this site which made the meal even better. My husband raved about how delicious this dinner was, and it will be in our regular rotation now. Thank you for a great recipe! :-)",
